<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Top 20 Australian Dividend Yields - March 26.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Top 20 Australian Dividend Yields - March 26.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Twenty highest dividend yields for Australian companies included in the 320-share All Ordinaries Index based on closing prices on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Dividends based on rolling 12 months.</p>
<p>Yields are not grossed up for franking credits.</p>
<p>					   Dividend</p>
<p>Rank Name		     Yield    Close</p>
<p> 1   Consol Rutile	 163.64    0.99</p>
<p> 2   Centro Prop	    16.01    2.17</p>
<p> 3   Bk of Queen	    13.09    6.19</p>
<p> 4   MT Leyshon Gold	12.20    2.05</p>
<p> 5   Prime Credit Tr	10.10    0.97</p>
<p> 6   Prop Income Inv	 9.69    1.04</p>
<p> 7   Aust Tour		 9.49    0.79</p>
